{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flameborn Heroine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer that offers a hack 'n' slash experience focused on action and strategic combat, with an engaging narrative that guides the player through various stages and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a challenging solo journey. Face enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.poster.avif?t=1762457914\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.webm?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.mp4?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the 13th cycle of the Crimson Moon, that very night, the shadows awoke\u2014ancient creatures, forgotten since the War of Ash, began to stir again. Cities burned, fields withered, and the people lost their faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village hidden among the mountains, lived Aurora, a young princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/78e71bfdf2006bca22b0f81b3c4962c1.poster.avif?t=1762457914\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/78e71bfdf2006bca22b0f81b3c4962c1.webm?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/78e71bfdf2006bca22b0f81b3c4962c1.mp4?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an attack by shadow creatures on her village is destroyed, and Aurora narrowly survives, something awakens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking revenge, the Goddess of Fire guides Aurora on her journey to restore peace to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Aurora on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOVEMENT MECHANICS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump \u2013 Allows the player to jump again in mid-air before landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Climb \u2013 Holds onto and climbs vertical walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide \u2013 The player can crouch and slide through low tunnels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENEMIES AND CHALLENGES</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol Enemy \u2013 Walks from side to side and changes direction upon colliding with walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Enemy \u2013 Hovers and follows the player when it enters their field of vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turret \u2013 Fires projectiles periodically when the player is nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling Platform \u2013 After the player steps on it, it collapses after a short time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLECTABLES AND POWER-UPS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins / Gems \u2013 Items that add points when collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart / Extra Life \u2013 Recovers health or increases maximum HP.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERACTION AND PROGRESSION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation Portal \u2013 Instantly transports the player to another area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint / Flag \u2013 Marks the respawn point after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving Platform \u2013 Automatically moves along horizontal or vertical paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085480?t=1762457914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/3fb43e9d522cde0a964bc987ab3fb05cd0f61021/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762457914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/eeab364aa879552d53e1a4d53a9081afd454638b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762457914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/eeab364aa879552d53e1a4d53a9081afd454638b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762457914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flameborn Heroine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer that offers a hack 'n' slash experience focused on action and strategic combat, with an engaging narrative that guides the player through various stages and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a challenging solo journey. Face enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.poster.avif?t=1762457914\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.webm?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/extras/c5327c94d35bae5c4cecf28e769a1f87.mp4?t=1762457914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History</p></