ers and follows the player when it enters their field of vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turret \u2013 Fires projectiles periodically when the player is nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling Platform \u2013 After the player steps on it, it collapses after a short time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLECTABLES AND POWER-UPS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins / Gems \u2013 Items that add points when collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart / Extra Life \u2013 Recovers health or increases maximum HP.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERACTION AND PROGRESSION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation Portal \u2013 Instantly transports the player to another area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint / Flag \u2013 Marks the respawn point after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving Platform \u2013 Automatically moves along horizontal or vertical paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nova Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085480/840bb4267efa0b08057bc30aaac096d2d5031fd8/header.jpg?t=1762457914","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085480/1995763833/8143605a912937fc0a8a65afa2b582c6dfbc5d66/1760148287/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762457912","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085480/1995763833/8143605a912937fc0a8a65afa2b582c6dfbc5d66/1760148287/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762457912","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085